# src/apps/android/app/src/main/java/com/luminet/android/plugin

## Purpose
Provides Android application integration for LumiNet plugin or extension behavior.

## Contents
Contains Kotlin/Java plugin-facing models, adapters, and lifecycle helpers used by the Android host application.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Bridges Android lifecycle/platform facilities with the application's plugin contracts and any shared configuration interfaces.

## Invariants
Plugin inputs must be validated at the boundary, plugin failures must remain isolated from host lifecycle state, and privileged/platform operations require explicit ownership.